    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of Post Apo Tycoon, where you will revive a post-apocalyptic fallout landscape after a nuclear explosion. \ud83d\udca3 Take on the challenge of exploring, building, and transforming the landscape back into a thriving ecosystem. Get out of your nuclear silo to fill in the grain silo and rebuild the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Extensive World \ud83c\udf0d</strong>: Discover a vast map with hidden treasures and resources, including repurposable abandoned silos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Lost Story \ud83d\udcd6</strong>: Find diaries that reveal the history behind the apocalypse as you explore the wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct and Upgrade \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f</strong>: Build and unlock structures to create a thriving society and customize your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore the Ecosystem \ud83c\udf31</strong>: Revitalize nature and purify the air in the devastated environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom \ud83c\udfa8</strong>: Focus on your creative vision without threats or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Gameplay Mechanics \u2699\ufe0f</strong>: Build and expand intricate city systems with rewarding upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Time Pressure \u23f3</strong>: Play at your own pace without deadlines, creating the society of your dreams.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter the world of Post Apo Tycoon, where you will revive a post-apocalyptic fallout landscape after a nuclear explosion. \ud83d\udca3 Take on the challenge of exploring, building, and transforming the landscape back into a thriving ecosystem. Get out of your nuclear silo to fill in the grain silo and rebuild the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore an Extensive World \ud83c\udf0d</strong>: Discover a vast map with hidden treasures and resources, including repurposable abandoned silos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Lost Story \ud83d\udcd6</strong>: Find diaries that reveal the history behind the apocalypse as you explore the wasteland.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Construct and Upgrade \ud83c\udfd7\ufe0f</strong>: Build and unlock structures to create a thriving society and customize your city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore the Ecosystem \ud83c\udf31</strong>: Revitalize nature and purify the air in the devastated environment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Creative Freedom \ud83c\udfa8</strong>: Focus on your creative vision without threats or enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Gameplay Mechanics \u2699\ufe0f</strong>: Build and expand intricate city systems with rewarding upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Time Pressure \u23f3</strong>: Play at your own pace without deadlines, creating the society of your dreams.</p></li></ul>",
